                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Christmas Adventure: Candy Storm is a cheerful hidden-object adventure with a fun holiday atmosphere. The candy-themed environments are especially fun to explore, and I liked looking for hidden objects while following the story.\r\n\r\nIt's not very difficult, but that's what makes it enjoyable for a casual playthrough. After a while, some of the tasks start to feel repetitive.\r\n\r\nA nice choice for getting into the holiday mood.\r\n\r\nEnjoy :)",
